5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I think we need to understand why the car isn't always ready when needed. I'll look into the state of the car at handover and the trips that repeat weekly.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,I'm more concerned about the time we waste coordinating everything. I'll check the hours of use recorded in the diary and the month's trial of recording every run.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Servas,,"To ensure a fair distribution of costs and a sustainable arrangement, I shall look into last year's tax, insurance and parking papers, as well as the spell of checking each other's figures.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I want to know why we've been getting grumpy with each other. I'll look into what two other car-sharing households said and the spell of checking each other's figures.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I want to know the real numbers so we can be fair! I'll look into last year's fuel receipts and the hours of use recorded in the diary.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,pass,Misaki,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,"Since we've all picked our focus, I'm curious if anyone else feels the coordination is the biggest headache. @Takumi, do you think the ""grumpiness"" comes from the scheduling or the money?","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@May, it is often the case that friction in our hearts stems from a perceived lack of balance in our contributions. Perhaps the coordination is merely the symptom of a deeper imbalance.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@May, I think it's both. When we're stressed about the schedule or money, we stop being nice. That's why I want to see what other people did to avoid fighting.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I agree with Takumi! It's no fun when we're grumpy. But I think we'll feel better once we stop guessing about the money and actually see who's driving the most.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"I agree that the atmosphere matters, but the practical side is just as important. If the car is dirty or empty when I need it, that's where the frustration starts for me.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,May,,"I see your point, Misaki. It's not just the time spent planning, but the disappointment when the reality doesn't match the plan. That's exactly why I want to see where those hours are actually going.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Servas,,"It is wise to acknowledge both the emotional and practical burdens. If we can align our expectations with the reality of our usage, the harmony of our group will surely return.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I just hope we don't end up fighting more while we try to fix this. We need a system that doesn't make us feel like we're policing each other.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"That's why we need the real figures now! If we have the facts, we don't have to police anyone because the numbers will tell the truth for us. It'll be way simpler!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I hope the facts help us find a solution that works for everyone. Let's see what we find out from the records and then decide on a better way forward.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,May,,"I'm looking forward to seeing the results. Hopefully, we can find a way to stop the endless arranging and just enjoy the car. Let's get to the findings!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Servas,,"Indeed. Let us approach the revelations with open minds and a spirit of generosity, remembering that our friendship is far more valuable than any vehicle.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"I agree. Let's just make sure we focus on fixing the system, not blaming each other, once we see the results. I'm ready to move on.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Kenji,,Me too! I'm super excited to see the real numbers. Let's do this and make everything fair for everyone!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
